        <mxCell id="c112" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 14.3, filtered to 2026; percentages read as the format 0.0% shows them. Outlined in coral: the Furniture row. Furniture&#x27;s largest decline, in October (outlined in amber), and its largest increase, in November (outlined in teal), are the cells to find. Services (-37.0% to 42.7%) and Textiles (-30.7% to 38.1%) swing the most.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="258" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
